      "notes": {
        "public": "",
        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8+3 (7 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +6</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 20 ft. (4 squares)</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 17 (+2 size, +2 Agy, +3 natural), touch 14, flat- footed 15</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +1/-8</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> Claws +2 melee (1d3-1) Claws +2 melee (1d3-1)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> Claws +2 melee (1d3-1)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 2-1/2 ft./0 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> Lesser firebolt (DC 13)</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Blindsight 60 ft., darkvision 60 ft., immunity to fire, spell resistance 11, demon traits</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +2, Ref +4, Will +0</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 8, Agy 14, Sta 11, Int 8, Spt 7, Cha 15</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Climb +3, Concentration +4, Knowledge (the planes) +3, Listen +2, Spot +2, Stealth +6 (+14 to hide), Use Magic Device +6</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Improved Initiative B , Toughness</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> The Twisting Nether</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> Solitary, pair, or gang (3-5)</p><p><strong>Treasure:</strong> Standard</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> 2-4 HD (Small); or by character class</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> -</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
